DESCRIPTION:Reminder to please join us for a short\, snappy protest to oppose AUKUS\, the nuclear creep and militarisation of our universities at this Australian Nuclear Submarine Conference.\nOur government is 'selling us out' to the imperialist US and UK\, joining in on the China fear mongering perpetuated by the US - putting our health\, safety and environment at risk.\nNuclear is Never Safe!\nConference sponsors include Defence West\, Curtin University and weapons companies implicated in the genocide in Palestine\, Babcock\, L3 Harris and Raytheon.\nConference Speakers include the ASA DG\, Jonathan Mead\; Director\, National Resilience & Security Program Officer and the Chief Security Officer (CSO)at Curtin University\, Gary Hale\; with Richard Marles tbc.\nWe have banners and placards - we just need you\, your hands and voices.\nHope to see you there!\nFor further conference details see https:// www.submarineinstitute.com/sia-conferences/program.html
DTEND:20250819T010000Z
LOCATION:Pan Pacific Perth\n207 Adelaide Tce
DTSTART:20250819T000000Z
SUMMARY:Protest Nuclear Submarines in Australia
